RPG Paper Maker - An RPG game maker engine but with 3d visuals

Links:
-Website: https://rpg-paper-maker.com
-Steam Page: https://store.steampowered.com/app/1066860/RPG_Paper_Maker/

Pros:
-Free as long as the projects aren’t making profit
-One time license purchase for commercial use
-User friendly UI
-Very beginner friendly
-Allows for more complex coding, plugins, and 3D model imports
-Works on Windows, macOS, and Linux
-Still being updated

Cons
-Commercial edition is a bit pricey ($79.99)
-Few pieces of documentation (Although easy to understand)
-Advanced coding only uses Javascript
-Model imports must be .obj
-Mainly for beginner projects
